   "version": "Introduced in House",
   "date": "2022-01-28",
   "text": "Prescription Freedom Act of 2022\n This bill generally eliminates the authority of the Food and Drug Administration (FDA) to require that a drug be dispensed only with a prescription. However, the FDA may continue to require a prescription for any drug intended for terminating a pregnancy."
  }
